meta {
  name: List Importable Radiology Tests
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/branch-radiology-tests/importable?page=1&limit=20
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 20
  ~search: CT Chest
  ~department: Radiology
  ~category: CT
  ~subCategory: Contrast
  ~excludeListId: {{branchRadiologyTestListId}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Import picker source for the branch-admin Radiology Test List "Add Tests to List"
  dialog ("Available to Add" panel): the active branch's **Radiology Master Data**
  tests, paginated. Business JWT; tenant + active branch from the token.

  Optional `search` (case-insensitive on testName/testCode), classification filters
  `department` / `category` / `subCategory` (matched by name), and `excludeListId`
  — when given, tests already present in that pricing list (matched via
  `BranchRadiologyTest.sourceRadiologyTestId`) are dropped server-side, so the
  "Available to Add" vs "Already in this list" split needs no client-side dedup.

  Rows are the FLAT radiology shape: `{ id, testName, testCode, modality, bodyPart }`.
  Shares its `where` with "Import Branch Radiology Tests By Filter" so the picker and
  a "select all" import resolve the identical set. 400 `ACTIVE_BRANCH_REQUIRED` if
  the JWT has no active branch.
}
